                <figcaption>
                  <strong>Wilson Siao</strong>
                  <span><span class="zh">创办人 · 脑性麻痹（Cerebral Palsy）健美运动员</span><span class="en">Founder · Bodybuilder with Cerebral Palsy</span><span class="ms">Pengasas · Pembina badan yang menghidap Cerebral Palsy</span></span>
                </figcaption>
              </figure>
