            <div class="story">
              <div class="label"><span class="zh">创办人的故事</span><span class="en">The Founder's Story</span><span class="ms">Kisah Pengasas</span></div>
              <h2 class="display"><span class="zh">Wilson Siao｜个人奋斗故事</span><span class="en">Wilson Siao · Personal Journey</span><span class="ms">Wilson Siao · Perjalanan Peribadi</span></h2>
              <p class="sub"><span class="zh">从身体挑战到国际健美比赛舞台</span><span class="en">From physical challenges to international bodybuilding stages</span><span class="ms">Daripada cabaran fizikal kepada pentas bina badan antarabangsa</span></p>

              <p><span class="zh">Wilson Siao 是一名来自马来西亚霹雳州的自然健美运动员，也是一名患有脑性麻痹（Cerebral Palsy）的 Adaptive Athlete。</span><span class="en">Wilson Siao is a natural bodybuilder from Perak, Malaysia, and an Adaptive Athlete living with Cerebral Palsy.</span><span class="ms">Wilson Siao ialah seorang atlet bina badan semula jadi dari Perak, Malaysia, dan seorang Atlet Adaptif yang hidup dengan Cerebral Palsy.</span></p>

              <p><span class="zh">从出生开始，他便因为脑性麻痹而面对身体协调、肌肉控制及行动方面的挑战。成长过程中，他经历了许多困难，也需要比一般人付出更多努力，才能完成一些日常生活中的事情。</span><span class="en">From birth, Cerebral Palsy presented him with challenges in coordination, muscle control, and mobility. Growing up, he overcame numerous difficulties, working harder than most just to perform everyday tasks.</span><span class="ms">Sejak lahir, Cerebral Palsy memberinya cabaran dari segi koordinasi, kawalan otot dan pergerakan. Sepanjang membesar, dia mengatasi pelbagai kesukaran dan perlu berusaha lebih gigih daripada kebanyakan orang hanya untuk melakukan tugas harian.</span></p>

              <p><span class="zh">对于他而言，身体上的挑战一直是人生的一部分，但他并不希望这些限制决定自己能够走多远。</span><span class="en">For him, physical challenges have always been part of life, but he refused to let these limitations define how far he could go.</span><span class="ms">Baginya, cabaran fizikal sentiasa menjadi sebahagian daripada hidup, tetapi dia enggan membenarkan had tersebut menentukan sejauh mana dia boleh pergi.</span></p>

              <h3><span class="zh">2018年｜开始接触健身</span><span class="en">2018 · Introduced to Fitness</span><span class="ms">2018 · Mula Mengenali Kecergasan</span></h3>
              <p><span class="zh">2018年，Wilson 开始接触健身训练。最初他希望通过运动改善自己的身体状况，随着时间过去，他逐渐对健美运动产生兴趣，并开始认真投入训练。</span><span class="en">In 2018, Wilson started fitness training. Initially aiming to improve his physical condition, he gradually developed an interest in bodybuilding and began training seriously.</span><span class="ms">Pada 2018, Wilson mula berlatih kecergasan. Pada mulanya dia ingin memperbaiki keadaan fizikalnya, namun lama-kelamaan dia mula berminat dengan bina badan dan mula berlatih dengan serius.</span></p>
              <p><span class="zh">由于脑性麻痹的影响，他在训练时需要面对身体协调、肌肉控制及动作稳定性等问题。一些普通运动员能够轻易完成的动作，对他而言可能需要更多时间练习和调整。但通过不断尝试和坚持，他逐渐累积了丰富的训练经验。</span><span class="en">Because of Cerebral Palsy, he had to deal with issues of coordination, muscle control and movement stability in training. Movements that other athletes perform easily could take him much more time to practise and adjust. Through constant trying and persistence, he gradually built up rich training experience.</span><span class="ms">Disebabkan Cerebral Palsy, dia perlu menghadapi masalah koordinasi, kawalan otot dan kestabilan pergerakan semasa latihan. Pergerakan yang mudah dilakukan atlet lain mungkin memerlukan masa yang jauh lebih lama untuk dilatih dan diselaraskan olehnya. Melalui percubaan berterusan dan ketabahan, dia secara beransur-ansur memperoleh pengalaman latihan yang kaya.</span></p>

              <h3><span class="zh">2022年｜开始接触健美舞台</span><span class="en">2022 · Stepping Onto the Stage</span><span class="ms">2022 · Melangkah ke Pentas</span></h3>
              <p><span class="zh">2022年7月，Wilson 开始参与 Mr. Perak 相关活动及嘉宾展示（Guest Posing），进一步接触健美比赛环境。这段经历让他对健美竞技产生更大的兴趣，也确定了自己希望成为一名健美运动员的决心。</span><span class="en">In July 2022, Wilson began taking part in Mr. Perak events and guest posing, getting closer to the bodybuilding competition environment. The experience deepened his interest in competitive bodybuilding and confirmed his determination to become a bodybuilder.</span><span class="ms">Pada Julai 2022, Wilson mula menyertai acara Mr. Perak dan persembahan jemputan (guest posing), lalu semakin dekat dengan suasana pertandingan bina badan. Pengalaman itu mengukuhkan minatnya terhadap bina badan kompetitif dan menguatkan tekadnya untuk menjadi pembina badan.</span></p>

              <h3><span class="zh">2023年｜参加人生第一场健美比赛</span><span class="en">2023 · First Bodybuilding Competition</span><span class="ms">2023 · Pertandingan Bina Badan Pertama</span></h3>
              <p><span class="zh">2023年6月，Wilson 正式参加人生中的第一场 Mr. Perak 健美比赛。站上比赛舞台不仅是一次竞技体验，也是对自己长期训练成果的检验。</span><span class="en">In June 2023, Wilson officially competed in his first Mr. Perak bodybuilding contest. Stepping onto the stage was not only a competitive experience, but also a test of his long-term training.</span><span class="ms">Pada Jun 2023, Wilson secara rasmi menyertai pertandingan bina badan Mr. Perak yang pertama. Berdiri di atas pentas bukan sahaja satu pengalaman bertanding, tetapi juga ujian terhadap latihan jangka panjangnya.</span></p>

              <h3><span class="zh">2024年｜参加国内及国际赛事</span><span class="en">2024 · Domestic and International Events</span><span class="ms">2024 · Acara Dalam dan Luar Negara</span></h3>
              <p><span class="zh">2024年，Wilson 持续参加不同健美组织举办的比赛，并获得以下成绩：</span><span class="en">In 2024, Wilson continued to compete in contests hosted by different bodybuilding organisations, achieving the following results:</span><span class="ms">Pada 2024, Wilson terus bertanding dalam pertandingan yang dianjurkan oleh pelbagai pertubuhan bina badan dan mencapai keputusan berikut:</span></p>
              <ul>
                <li>WNBF Macau — Bodybuilding Special Award</li>
                <li>WNBF Malaysia — Bodybuilding Special Award &amp; Men's Physique Teen 4th</li>
                <li>NPC Natural Regional Malaysia — Bodybuilding Special Award &amp; Men's Physique Junior B 4th</li>
              </ul>

              <h3><span class="zh">2025年｜受邀前往澳大利亚参赛</span><span class="en">2025 · Invited to Compete in Australia</span><span class="ms">2025 · Dijemput Bertanding di Australia</span></h3>
              <p><span class="zh">2025年10月，Wilson 受邀前往澳大利亚参加 WNBF Australia 国际健美比赛。在这次比赛中，他于 Adaptive Bodybuilding 组别荣获 Special Award，并在 Junior Men's Physique 组别获得 3rd 铜牌。</span><span class="en">In October 2025, Wilson was invited to Australia to compete in the WNBF Australia international bodybuilding contest. There he won the Special Award in the Adaptive Bodybuilding category and 3rd place (bronze) in Junior Men's Physique.</span><span class="ms">Pada Oktober 2025, Wilson dijemput ke Australia untuk bertanding dalam pertandingan bina badan antarabangsa WNBF Australia. Di sana dia memenangi Anugerah Khas dalam kategori Adaptive Bodybuilding dan tempat ke-3 (gangsa) dalam Junior Men's Physique.</span></p>

              <h3><span class="zh">2026年｜成立 KBBA 适应性健美俱乐部</span><span class="en">2026 · Founding KBBA</span><span class="ms">2026 · Penubuhan KBBA</span></h3>
              <p><span class="zh">2026年9月，Wilson Siao 创办并正式成立 KELAB BINA BADAN ADAPTIF（KBBA），致力于推动马来西亚 Adaptive Bodybuilding 与 Natural Bodybuilding 的发展。</span><span class="en">In September 2026, Wilson Siao founded KELAB BINA BADAN ADAPTIF (KBBA), dedicated to advancing the development of Adaptive Bodybuilding and Natural Bodybuilding in Malaysia.</span><span class="ms">Pada September 2026, Wilson Siao menubuhkan KELAB BINA BADAN ADAPTIF (KBBA), yang berazam memajukan Adaptive Bodybuilding dan Natural Bodybuilding di Malaysia.</span></p>
              <p><span class="zh">俱乐部成立的初衷，是为更多 Adaptive Athletes 提供健美赛事资讯、参赛方向及竞技发展机会，让不同身体能力的运动员都能够追求自己的健美梦想。</span><span class="en">The club was founded to give more Adaptive Athletes bodybuilding event information, entry guidance and opportunities for competitive development, so that athletes of every physical ability can pursue their bodybuilding dreams.</span><span class="ms">Kelab ini ditubuhkan untuk memberi lebih ramai Atlet Adaptif maklumat pertandingan bina badan, panduan penyertaan dan peluang pembangunan kompetitif, supaya atlet dengan pelbagai keupayaan fizikal dapat mengejar impian bina badan mereka.</span></p>
              <p><span class="zh">Wilson 希望通过 KBBA，建立一个更加包容的健美平台，连接运动员、健美组织及赛事主办单位，为马来西亚 Adaptive Athletes 创造更多参与本地及国际比赛的机会。</span><span class="en">Through KBBA, Wilson hopes to build a more inclusive bodybuilding platform that connects athletes, bodybuilding organisations and event organisers, creating more opportunities for Malaysian Adaptive Athletes to compete in local and international contests.</span><span class="ms">Melalui KBBA, Wilson berharap dapat membina platform bina badan yang lebih inklusif yang menghubungkan atlet, pertubuhan bina badan dan penganjur acara, serta mewujudkan lebih banyak peluang untuk Atlet Adaptif Malaysia bertanding di peringkat tempatan dan antarabangsa.</span></p>

              <h3><span class="zh">2026年｜出任 WNBF Malaysia Para &amp; Adaptive 部门主管</span><span class="en">2026 · Head, Para &amp; Adaptive Department, WNBF Malaysia</span><span class="ms">2026 · Head, Para &amp; Adaptive Department, WNBF Malaysia</span></h3>
              <p><span class="zh">2026年，Wilson Siao 获 WNBF Malaysia 委任为 Head, Para &amp; Adaptive Department in WNBF Malaysia，负责推动及关注 Para &amp; Adaptive Athletes 在自然健美领域的发展。</span><span class="en">In 2026, Wilson Siao was appointed by WNBF Malaysia as Head, Para &amp; Adaptive Department in WNBF Malaysia, responsible for promoting and looking after the development of Para &amp; Adaptive Athletes in natural bodybuilding.</span><span class="ms">Pada 2026, Wilson Siao dilantik oleh WNBF Malaysia sebagai Head, Para &amp; Adaptive Department in WNBF Malaysia, bertanggungjawab menggalakkan dan menjaga perkembangan Atlet Para &amp; Adaptif dalam bina badan semula jadi.</span></p>
              <p><span class="zh">这项委任进一步体现了马来西亚 Para &amp; Adaptive Bodybuilding 的发展方向，也成为推动 KELAB BINA BADAN ADAPTIF 成立的重要背景之一。俱乐部希望通过赛事资讯、参赛方向及相关支持，为更多 Adaptive Athletes 创造参与健美竞技的机会。</span><span class="en">This appointment further reflects the direction of Para &amp; Adaptive Bodybuilding in Malaysia, and is an important part of the background to the founding of KELAB BINA BADAN ADAPTIF. Through event information, entry guidance and related support, the club hopes to create opportunities for more Adaptive Athletes to take part in bodybuilding competition.</span><span class="ms">Pelantikan ini seterusnya mencerminkan hala tuju Bina Badan Para &amp; Adaptif di Malaysia, dan merupakan sebahagian penting latar belakang penubuhan KELAB BINA BADAN ADAPTIF. Melalui maklumat pertandingan, panduan penyertaan dan sokongan berkaitan, kelab berharap dapat mewujudkan peluang kepada lebih ramai Atlet Adaptif untuk menyertai pertandingan bina badan.</span></p>

