    <div class="band alt" id="our-story" data-page="story">
      <section>
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="sec-head">
            <div class="label"><span class="zh">OUR STORY｜俱乐部故事</span><span class="en">OUR STORY｜Our Story</span><span class="ms">KISAH KAMI｜Kisah Kami</span></div>
            <h2 class="display"><span class="zh">OUR STORY｜<span class="gold-text">俱乐部故事</span></span><span class="en">OUR STORY｜<span class="gold-text">Adaptive Bodybuilding Club</span></span><span class="ms">KISAH KAMI｜<span class="gold-text">Kelab Bina Badan Adaptif</span></span></h2>
          </div>
          <div class="story-grid">
          <div class="story-logo">
            <img src="logo-kbba.jpg" alt="Kelab Bina Badan Adaptif logo">
          </div>
          <div style="max-width:820px;color:#cdd8f0;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.9;">
            <p><span class="zh">KELAB BINA BADAN ADAPTIF 于2026年9月17日在马来西亚正式成立。</span><span class="en">KELAB BINA BADAN ADAPTIF was officially established in Malaysia on September 17, 2026.</span><span class="ms">KELAB BINA BADAN ADAPTIF secara rasmi ditubuhkan di Malaysia pada 17 September 2026.</span></p>
            <p><span class="zh">俱乐部的成立，是为了推动马来西亚 Adaptive Bodybuilding（适应性健美运动） 及 Natural Bodybuilding（自然健美） 的发展，并为更多 OKU（残障人士）创造参与健美运动及竞技比赛的机会。</span><span class="en">The club was founded to promote Adaptive Bodybuilding and Natural Bodybuilding in Malaysia, creating opportunities for more persons with disabilities (OKU).</span><span class="ms">Kelab ini ditubuhkan untuk menggalakkan Adaptive Bodybuilding dan Natural Bodybuilding di Malaysia, serta mewujudkan peluang untuk lebih ramai orang kurang upaya (OKU).</span></p>
            <p><span class="zh">我们相信，体育运动不应该受到身体条件的限制。每个人都应该拥有参与运动、挑战自我、展现能力及追求竞技梦想的机会。</span><span class="en">We believe sports should not be limited by physical conditions. Everyone deserves the opportunity to participate and challenge themselves.</span><span class="ms">Kami percaya sukan tidak sepatutnya dihadkan oleh keadaan fizikal. Semua orang berhak mendapat peluang untuk menyertai dan mencabar diri sendiri.</span></p>
            <p><span class="zh">在马来西亚，部分 OKU 人士虽然对健美运动充满兴趣，却可能因为缺乏比赛资讯、参赛渠道、相关资源及支持，而难以进一步参与竞技赛事。因此，俱乐部希望建立一个更加包容的健美平台。</span><span class="en">In Malaysia, while some OKU individuals have a deep interest in bodybuilding, they may find it difficult to enter competitions due to lack of event info. The club aims to establish a more inclusive platform.</span><span class="ms">Di Malaysia, walaupun sebahagian individu OKU sangat berminat dengan bina badan, mereka mungkin sukar menyertai pertandingan kerana kekurangan maklumat acara. Kelab ini bertujuan membina platform yang lebih inklusif.</span></p>
